### 3. Client Tool: pqpg (Post-Quantum Privacy Guard)

For users operating on the modern post-quantum channel, we provide pqpg, a standalone cryptographic CLI utility written in pure Rust (memory-safe, zero external C dependencies, deterministic zeroize memory hygiene, ML-KEM-768, X25519, ChaCha20-Poly1305, Ed25519, and terminal QR code transfer).

#### Quick Download (Linux x86_64 standalone binary, 1.2 MB)
=> /bin/pqpg-linux-amd64 Download pqpg-linux-amd64 (1.2 MB)
=> /bin/pqpg-linux-amd64.sha256 SHA256 Checksum

```
curl -sSL https://nymserv-ng.virebent.art/bin/pqpg-linux-amd64 -o ~/bin/pqpg
chmod +x ~/bin/pqpg
```

SHA256:
`fc1eabc6ec800b494545f558f520ec3493741977664d960cb2e7be75ea46e415`

